diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index af50d9b..a5de7c7 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -110,3 +110,13 @@ BitChord is licensed under [GPL-3.0](LICENSE).
 - [ytm-rs](https://github.com/grapedjuice/ytm-rs) for the basic rust backend.
 - Lyrics, metadata, playback, and integrations depend on the upstream libraries and third-party services used by this project.
 
+
+---
+
+## Mochy skin
+
+This build wears Mochy Music's look: pure-black dark theme, Inter, the floating pill tab bar
+(Home, Search, Library, Settings) and its spring animation, and Mochy's app icon.
+The tab bar is modelled on [Mochy Music](https://github.com/realidkroo/Mochy-Music) (GPL-3.0) and the
+app is based on [BitChord PC](https://github.com/jackychan4891/BitChord-PC-Official) (GPL-3.0),
+so the combination is GPL-3.0 as well.
